These shell commands are defined internally.
␀␀
WiFi Commands:␀  wifi off (Disconnects Wifi)␀␀␀  wifi on  (Connects to a known Wifi network. if there's no known network, starts in AP Mode)␀␀␀  wifi add "SSID" "Password" (adds a network to the list)␀␀␀  arp - Starts Scan Hosts ARP Scanner␀␀␀  listen   - Starts listening TCP default port␀␀  sniffer - Starts Raw Sniffer␀␀
WebUI Commands:␀␀␀␀  webui      - WebUI Webserver start␀␀␀␀
IR Commands:␀␀␀  ir rx <timeout>      - Read an IR signal and print the dump on serialDevice->␀  ir rx raw <timeout>  - Read an IR signal in RAW mode and print the dump on serialDevice->␀  ir tx <protocol> <address> <decoded_value>  - Send a custom decoded IR signal.␀␀␀␀  ir tx_from_file <ir file path> [hide default UI true/false] - Send an IR signal saved in storage. Optionally hide the default UI.␀
RF Commands:␀␀␀  subghz rx <timeout>       - Read an RF signal and print the dump on serialDevice-> (alias: rf rx)␀  subghz rx raw <timeout>   - Read an RF signal in RAW mode and print the dump on serialDevice-> (alias: rf rx raw)␀  subghz tx <decoded_value> <frequency> <te> <count>  - Send a custom decoded RF signal. (alias: rf tx)␀  subghz tx_from_file <sub file path> [hide default UI true/false] - Send an RF signal saved in storage. Optionally hide the default UI.␀␀␀␀
Audio Commands:␀␀␀␀  music_player <audio file path>  - Play an audio file.␀  tone <frequency> <duration>  - Play a single squarewave audio tone.␀␀␀  say <text>   - Text-To-Speech (speaker required).␀
UI Commands:␀␀␀  led <r/g/b> <0-255>    - Change the UI main color.␀␀␀␀  clock                 - Show the clock UI.␀␀␀␀
Power Management:␀␀  power <off/reboot/sleep>  - General power management.␀
GPIO Commands:␀  gpio mode <pin number> <0/1>  - Set GPIO pins mode (0=input, 1=output).␀␀␀  gpio set <pin number> <0/1>   - Direct GPIO pins control (0=off, 1=on).␀␀␀
I2C and Storage:␀␀␀  i2c scan                - Scan for modules connected to the I2C bus.␀␀  storage <list/remove/mkdir/rename/read/write/copy/md5/crc32> <file path>  - Common file management commands.␀␀  ls - Same as storage list␀
Settings:␀␀  settings                - View all the current settings.␀␀  settings <name>         - View a single setting value.␀␀␀␀  settings <name> <new value>  - Alter a single setting value.␀␀  factory_reset           - Reset to default configuration.␀Clock not set␀␀␀Current time: ␀␀I2C device found at address 0x␀␀Unknown error at address 0x␀No I2C devices found␀␀␀␀Total heap: ␀␀␀␀Free heap: ␀Total PSRAM: ␀␀␀Free PSRAM: ␀␀␀␀Homebrew␀␀␀␀SDK: ␀␀␀MAC addr: ␀␀Wifi: connected␀Ip: ␀␀␀␀Wifi: not connected␀Device: ␀␀␀␀Bruce C5 1.47 N8R8␀␀Display: Started async serial␀␀␀Display: Stopped async serial␀␀␀status␀␀Display: Logging tft is ACTIVATED␀␀␀Display: Logging tft is DEACTIVATED␀Binary Dump:␀␀␀␀
